{
  "info": {

    "name": "Heart Disease Prediction - Unified API (Clean)",
    "_postman_id": "hd-prediction-api-2026-clean",
    "description": "Frontend-ready collection using Node Gateway (primary) + optional AI service (dev only).",

    "name": "Heart Disease Prediction - Unified API (Simple)",
    "_postman_id": "hd-prediction-api-2026-simple",
    "description": "Frontend-ready minimal collection.\n\nSecurity: ML/SHAP/report are NOT exposed on FastAPI to browsers. Always call the Node backend; it talks to the internal AI service with X-INTERNAL-API-KEY.\n\nFlow:\n1) Auth → Register (any user)\n2) Auth → Login (saves token; clears labtest_id + prediction_id)\n3) Lab Tests → Upload CSV (current user) (saves labtest_id)\n4) Lab Tests → Get My Status (me)\n5) Predictions → Start Prediction (JWT) — uses latest lab test for your national_id; saves prediction_id\n6) Predictions → Get SHAP PNG / Get PDF Report (JWT, high-risk flow) — use prediction_id from step 5\n\nRules:\n- If Get My Status says hasLabTests=false ⇒ show Labs page\n- If prediction decision=low ⇒ show only decision + probability\n- If prediction decision=high ⇒ show hospitals + SHAP + report (when show_shap/show_report are true)\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:5000 (Node API gateway only).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:5000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "labtest_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "prediction_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"national_id\": \"\",\n  \"username\": \"\",\n  \"email\": \"\",\n  \"password\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"\",\n  \"password\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 && json.token) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('token', json.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('labtest_id', '');",

                  "  pm.environment.set('prediction_id', '');",
                  "}"
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('labtest_id', '');",
                  "  pm.environment.set('prediction_id', '');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('prediction_id', '');",
                  "}",
                  "console.log('Login response:', json);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lab Tests",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upload CSV (self)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/labtests/upload-csv",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "labtests", "upload-csv"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/labtests/me/status",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "labtests", "me", "status"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Labs",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Labs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/labs?page=1&limit=50",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "labs"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Hospitals",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Hospitals",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/hospitals?page=1&limit=50",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "hospitals"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {

      "name": "Predictions (Gateway - SAFE)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Start Prediction",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"

      "name": "Predictions (Backend gateway)",
      "description": "JWT required. Node calls internal FastAPI — do not hit :8000 /predict or /shap from the frontend.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Start Prediction",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201 && json.success && json.data && json.data.prediction_id) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('prediction_id', json.data.prediction_id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('prediction_id', json.data.prediction_id);",
                  "  console.log('✅ prediction_id saved:', json.data.prediction_id);",
                  "}",
                  "console.log('Start prediction:', json);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/predictions/start",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "predictions", "start"]

            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get SHAP",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],

            },
            "description": "Uses the latest LabTest row for the logged-in user's national_id. Response data includes prediction_id for SHAP/report."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get SHAP (PNG)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/predictions/{{prediction_id}}/shap",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "predictions", "{{prediction_id}}", "shap"]

            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Report",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],

            },
            "description": "Returns image/png. prediction_id from Start Prediction (not labtest_id)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Medical Report (PDF)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/predictions/{{prediction_id}}/report",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "predictions", "{{prediction_id}}", "report"]

            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "AI (DEV ONLY)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Predict (direct AI)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ai_url}}/predict/{{labtest_id}}",
              "host": ["{{ai_url}}"],
              "path": ["predict", "{{labtest_id}}"]
            }

            },
            "description": "Returns application/pdf. Ownership enforced — only your prediction."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

}
